### Create a new Session

    Purpose:
        Create a session for a user and return the session log UUID for future updates.
    Endpoint:
        /session/create/{user_id}/{session_type}
    Request Method:
        POST
    Request Parameters:
        1. user_id | int | required | min1 
        2. session_type | string | required | min1 | max50
        Example:
            POST /session/create/1/tibetan_singing_bowl_mr
    Request Header:
        1. Authorization | `Bearer <token>` | required
        Example:
            {
                `Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...`
            }
    Result Body (JSON):
        1. user_id | int
        2. session_type | string
        3. uuid | string | required
        Exmaple:
            {
                "user_id": 1,
                "session_type": "tibetan_singing_bowl_mr",
                "uuid": "e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000"
            }
    Success:
        201 - Session successfully created
    Failure:
        400 - Bad request, one of the params are invalid. 
        401 - Unauthorized (token incorrect or expired)
        500 - Server Error

### Update starting mood before starting a session

    Purpose:
        Update starting mood for a session
    Endpoint:
        /session/update/start/{session_uuid}/{session_type}
    Request Method:
        POST
    Request Header:
        1. Authorization | `Bearer <token>` | required
        Example:
            {
                `Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...`
            }
    Request Parameters:
        1.  session_uuid | string | required | min1 
        2.  session_type | string | required | min1 | max50
        Example:
                /session/update/e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000/tibetan_singing_bowl_mr
    Request Body (JSON):
        1. start_mood_rating | int16 | required | min1 
        2. start_mood | string | required | min1 | max20
        Example:
            {
                "start_mood_rating": 3,
                "start_mood": "angry"
            }
    Result Body (JSON):
        None
    Success:
        204 - Updated succesful and no content 
    Failure:
        401 - Unauthorized (token incorrect or expired)
        404 - session does not exist in the database
        500 - Server Error

### Update Finish Mood just before finishing a session

    Purpose:
        Update finishing mood for a session
    Endpoint:
        /session/update/finish/{session_uuid}/{session_type}
    Request Method:
        POST
    Request Parameters:
        1.  session_uuid | string | required
        2.  session_type | string | required
        Example:
                /session/update/finish/e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000/tibetan_singing_bowl_mr
    Request Header:
        1. Authorization | `Bearer <token>` | required
        Example:
        {
            `Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...`
        }
    Request Body (JSON):
        1. finish_mood_rating | int | required
        2. finish_mood | string | required
        2. ends_at | string | required | (ISO 8601 format)
        Example:
            {
                "finish_mood_rating": 5,
                "finish_mood": "happy",
                "ends_at": "2024-12-28T12:34:56.789Z"
            }
    Result Body (JSON):
        {
            "session_uuid": "e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000",
            "update_status": "success"
        }
    How to send Timestamp from unity?:
        1. generate timestamp in unity
            DateTime timestamp = DateTime.UtcNow; // Current time in UTC
        2. convert timestamp to string
            string iso8601Timestamp = timestamp.ToString("o"); // Format: "2024-12-28T12:34:56.789Z"
    Success:
        200 - session updated successfully
    Failure:
        401 - Unauthorized (token incorrect or expired)
        404 - session does not exist in the database
        500 - Server Error

### Quit a session without completing it

    Purpose:
        Update session data when user quits a session without finishing it
    Endpoint:
        /session/quite/{session_uuid}/{session_type}
    Request Method:
        POST
    Request Parameters:
        1.  session_uuid | string | required
        2.  session_type | string | required
        Example:
                /session/quite/e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000/tibetan_singing_bowl_mr
    Request Header:
        1. Authorization | `Bearer <token>` | required
        Example:
        {
            `Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...`
        }
    Request Body (JSON):
        2. ends_at | string | required | (ISO 8601 format)
        Example:
            {
                "ends_at": "2024-12-28T12:34:56.789Z"
            }
    Result Body (JSON):
        {
            "session_uuid": "e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000",
            "update_status": "success"
        }
    How to send Timestamp from unity?:
        1. generate timestamp in unity
            DateTime timestamp = DateTime.UtcNow; // Current time in UTC
        2. convert timestamp to string
            string iso8601Timestamp = timestamp.ToString("o"); // Format: "2024-12-28T12:34:56.789Z"
    Success:
        200 - session updated successfully
    Failure:
        401 - Unauthorized (token incorrect or expired)
        404 - session does not exist in the database
        500 - Server Error
